| F# | sidebar | 1 | 30.0 | 1/1 | 1.01 |
| F# | sidebar | 16 | 30.0 | 1/1 | 0.99 |
| F# | post_message | 1 | 30.0 | 1/1 | 1.00 |
| F# | post_message | 16 | 90.9 | 0/1 **←** | 1.11 |

